# Query: Bidirectional Traceability

Spec: QueryTraceability
Purpose:
  Trace requirements ↔ decisions ↔ tasks ↔ code ↔ tests ↔ proof.

Query:
  FORWARD:  requirement → decision → task → code → test → proof
  REVERSE:  code → task → decision → requirement

  Compact IDs:
    R<id>  — Requirement
    D<id>  — Decision
    T<id>  — Task
    C<id>  — Code artifact
    X<id>  — Test
    P<id>  — Proof

  output:
    trace_chain:
      direction: <forward | reverse>
      start: <@entity>
      nodes:
        - id: <R101 | D202 | ...>
          type: <requirement | decision | task | code | test | proof>
          artifact: <path or reference>
          status: <active | deprecated | superseded>

SavedAs: @query:traceability

Navigation:
  Parent: @../INDEX.sdd
  DriftSpec: @../lifecycle/drift.sdd
  EpistemicStates: @../concepts/epistemic-entities.sdd
  Decisions: @../decisions/INDEX.sdd

State: +
